T TO BRING BACK ITEMS FROM WEDDING&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I CAN COLLECT THEM FOR MY FUTURE WEDDING NEXT YEAR. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;PLEASE AND THANKS IN ADVANCE.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1901978,"PostDate":1438819957,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I WILL BE IN JAMAICA AUG 16 TO 27TH. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>IF YOU DONT WANT TO BRING BACK ITEMS FROM WEDDING<\/p>\n<p>I CAN COLLECT THEM FOR MY FUTURE WEDDING NEXT YEAR. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>PLEASE AND THANKS IN ADVANCE.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dathotgal51@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"173.77.182.126","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1423447125,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282047.jpg?_r=1445086348","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":204,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"dathotgal","Id":282047,"Name":"dathotgal","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79471","Title":"Dont Hassle To Bring Back Jamaica Wedding Decor","LastPostDate":1438819957},"Pages":{"TotalItems":1,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
