ending&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Stamps - Pending&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Everything else is still available :).&amp;nbsp; Adding a few new items and copying the still available items below.&amp;nbsp; Preference again goes first to local Toronto ladies who can meet\/pick up&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;New Items&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;1.&amp;nbsp; Heart shaped chalkboard on scalloped metal tin - Rustic style -&amp;nbsp; $8&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Erasable and I will include some chalk&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-b-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/s960x960\/10914965_10152961357012510_8827747332525538679_o.jpg\" alt=\"10914965_10152961357012510_8827747332525\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-b-ord.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xap1\/v\/t1.0-9\/10444647_10152961356902510_5050287609616790647_n.jpg?oh=c1e10694b855f49516e285c33d38410f&amp;amp;oe=5528DFA0\" alt=\"10444647_10152961356902510_5050287609616\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2.&amp;nbsp; Custom \"Better Together\" cake topper - $35&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wooden script - Gold - Comes in a beautiful box&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-e-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xap1\/v\/t1.0-9\/10350353_10152961373892510_598656844041722757_n.jpg?oh=4c68a43c210fc9a0db440ac538c6e50e&amp;amp;oe=5561CDD7&amp;amp;__gda__=1433036014_af3ac2e46cba25b2bed10055229a1e42\" alt=\"10350353_10152961373892510_5986568440417\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/img0.etsystatic.com\/023\/1\/6322320\/il_570xN.574320668_mnh1.jpg\" alt=\"il_570xN.574320668_mnh1.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3. Gently used pinned corsage and bouteniere from Bloom Bridal.&amp;nbsp; $5 each or $8 for both&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Corsage is 9\/10 and bouteniere is 8\/10 (my parents wore these)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/s15.postimg.org\/52hcoyicb\/Screen_Shot_2015_01_22_at_3_54_26_PM.png\" alt=\"Screen_Shot_2015_01_22_at_3_54_26_PM.png\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;4.&amp;nbsp; BHLDN Dalloway Earrings - $80&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;These are really pretty and light weight.&amp;nbsp; Didn&#039;t end up wearing these to my wedding but wore them once at our White party.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;BHLDN link for more details: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bhldn.com\/product\/dalloway-earrings&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.bhldn.com\/product\/dalloway-earrings&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/s7d1.scene7.com\/is\/image\/BHLDN\/30830863_011_a?$zoom-xl$\" alt=\"30830863_011_a?$zoom-xl$\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-d-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xpa1\/v\/t1.0-9\/10419414_813661832028797_6132291071517022815_n.jpg?oh=51ff7b37640771ec4802f939889fd3bf&amp;amp;oe=555FDCAA&amp;amp;__gda__=1431814162_797b66bbb16b838c123f18ba72d2d450\" alt=\"10419414_813661832028797_613229107151702\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;u&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Still Available (Pics in first post)&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/u&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5.&amp;nbsp; Anthropologie LOVE mugs - Selling as a set for $15 - LOCAL SALE ONLY&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We used these on our cake table, filled w\/ flowers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;6. Lot of 4 picture frames in gold and white.&amp;nbsp; Selling the lot for $15 - LOCAL SALE ONLY&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;1 is baroque white style, 1 is white w\/ a subtle print.&amp;nbsp; 1 is gold rimmed and mirrored chrome and 1 is plain gold. We used these to decorate our guestbook\/welcome table.&amp;nbsp; Bought from Homesense.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;7. 1 ring bearer suspender and bowtie sets worn once - $10 each &lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;These are SO cute.&amp;nbsp; They fit size: 9 MONTHS - 4 YEARS and are adjustable. They are navy suspenders, grey and white gingham check bowtie&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;8. 4 132\" round blush pink crinkle taffeta tablecloths.&amp;nbsp; Prefer to sell as a group for $60 total&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;These fit tables up to 72\" but would look best on standard 66\" or 72\" round tables.&amp;nbsp; Pictured here with 72\" round tables.&amp;nbsp; Used once and have been washed.&amp;nbsp; Great because the crinkle look means they don&#039;t have to be ironed or steamed.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;9. 2 90\"x156\" matching blush pink crinkle taffeta table drapes. $20 each or both for $30&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We used 1 for our head table and 1 for our welcome\/guestbook table.&amp;nbsp; They will fit standard 8&#039; rectangular tables&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;10. Black and white striped runner - Selling for $15&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;This will fit an 8 foot table perfectly.&amp;nbsp; Dimensions are 16\" wide and 156\" long (will hit the floor).&amp;nbsp; Had this custom made to use at our head table.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;11.&amp;nbsp; Gold sequin 120\" round table cloth.&amp;nbsp; Selling for $55 &lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I LOVE this tablecloth and I want to keep it but my husband said we have no use for it haha.&amp;nbsp; We used this on our cake table (square table) and it was great. Sequins are square shaped and gold&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;12. 5 plastic table number frames from Michaels. All for $5&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I spray painted them gold and tore out the plastic sheet so it looked less cheap.&amp;nbsp; They measure about 3-4 inches long each.&amp;nbsp; I can leave in my table number cards - printed on a gold shimmer cardstock.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1883808,"PostDate":1421961975,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi ladies,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Gold votives\/led lights - SOLD<\/p>\n<p>Wally bag - Pending sold<\/p>\n<p>Bouts - Pending sold<\/p>\n<p>1 Ring bearer outfit - Pending sold<\/p>\n<p>Bridesmaid bouquets - Pending<\/p>\n<p>Stamps - Pending<\/p>\n<p>Everything else is still available <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>.\u00a0 Adding a few new items and copying the still available items below.\u00a0 Preference again goes first to local Toronto ladies who can meet\/pick up<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><u><strong>New Items<\/strong><\/u><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>1.\u00a0 Heart shaped chalkboard on scalloped metal tin - Rustic style -\u00a0 $8<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Erasable and I will include some chalk<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-b-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/s960x960\/10914965_10152961357012510_8827747332525538679_o.jpg\" alt=\"10914965_10152961357012510_8827747332525\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-b-ord.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xap1\/v\/t1.0-9\/10444647_10152961356902510_5050287609616790647_n.jpg?oh=c1e10694b855f49516e285c33d38410f&oe=5528DFA0\" alt=\"10444647_10152961356902510_5050287609616\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>2.\u00a0 Custom \"Better Together\" cake topper - $35<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Wooden script - Gold - Comes in a beautiful box<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-e-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xap1\/v\/t1.0-9\/10350353_10152961373892510_598656844041722757_n.jpg?oh=4c68a43c210fc9a0db440ac538c6e50e&oe=5561CDD7&__gda__=1433036014_af3ac2e46cba25b2bed10055229a1e42\" alt=\"10350353_10152961373892510_5986568440417\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/img0.etsystatic.com\/023\/1\/6322320\/il_570xN.574320668_mnh1.jpg\" alt=\"il_570xN.574320668_mnh1.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>3. Gently used pinned corsage and bouteniere from Bloom Bridal.\u00a0 $5 each or $8 for both<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Corsage is 9\/10 and bouteniere is 8\/10 (my parents wore these)<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/s15.postimg.org\/52hcoyicb\/Screen_Shot_2015_01_22_at_3_54_26_PM.png\" alt=\"Screen_Shot_2015_01_22_at_3_54_26_PM.png\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>4.\u00a0 BHLDN Dalloway Earrings - $80<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>These are really pretty and light weight.\u00a0 Didn't end up wearing these to my wedding but wore them once at our White party.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>BHLDN link for more details: <a href='http:\/\/www.bhldn.com\/product\/dalloway-earrings' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.bhldn.com...lloway-earrings<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/s7d1.scene7.com\/is\/image\/BHLDN\/30830863_011_a?$zoom-xl$\" alt=\"30830863_011_a?$zoom-xl$\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-d-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xpa1\/v\/t1.0-9\/10419414_813661832028797_6132291071517022815_n.jpg?oh=51ff7b37640771ec4802f939889fd3bf&oe=555FDCAA&__gda__=1431814162_797b66bbb16b838c123f18ba72d2d450\" alt=\"10419414_813661832028797_613229107151702\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><u><strong>Still Available (Pics in first post)<\/strong><\/u><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>5.\u00a0 Anthropologie LOVE mugs - Selling as a set for $15 - LOCAL SALE ONLY<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>We used these on our cake table, filled w\/ flowers.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>6. Lot of 4 picture frames in gold and white.\u00a0 Selling the lot for $15 - LOCAL SALE ONLY<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>1 is baroque white style, 1 is white w\/ a subtle print.\u00a0 1 is gold rimmed and mirrored chrome and 1 is plain gold. We used these to decorate our guestbook\/welcome table.\u00a0 Bought from Homesense.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>7. 1 ring bearer suspender and bowtie sets worn once - $10 each <\/strong><\/p>\n<p>These are SO cute.\u00a0 They fit size: 9 MONTHS - 4 YEARS and are adjustable. They are navy suspenders, grey and white gingham check bowtie<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>8. 4 132\" round blush pink crinkle taffeta tablecloths.\u00a0 Prefer to sell as a group for $60 total<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>These fit tables up to 72\" but would look best on standard 66\" or 72\" round tables.\u00a0 Pictured here with 72\" round tables.\u00a0 Used once and have been washed.\u00a0 Great because the crinkle look means they don't have to be ironed or steamed.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>9. 2 90\"x156\" matching blush pink crinkle taffeta table drapes. $20 each or both for $30<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>We used 1 for our head table and 1 for our welcome\/guestbook table.\u00a0 They will fit standard 8' rectangular tables<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>10. Black and white striped runner - Selling for $15<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>This will fit an 8 foot table perfectly.\u00a0 Dimensions are 16\" wide and 156\" long (will hit the floor).\u00a0 Had this custom made to use at our head table.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>11.\u00a0 Gold sequin 120\" round table cloth.\u00a0 Selling for $55 <\/strong><\/p>\n<p>I LOVE this tablecloth and I want to keep it but my husband said we have no use for it haha.\u00a0 We used this on our cake table (square table) and it was great. Sequins are square shaped and gold<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>12. 5 plastic table number frames from Michaels. All for $5<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>I spray painted them gold and tore out the plastic sheet so it looked less cheap.\u00a0 They measure about 3-4 inches long each.\u00a0 I can leave in my table number cards - printed on a gold shimmer cardstock.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Married December 19, 2014 at Beach Palace Resort in Cancun, Mexico<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Planning Thread - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Wedding Review<\/p>\n<p>Part 1 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881197'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881197<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Part 2 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881590'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881590<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Part 3 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881861'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881861<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"lilyluu83@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.119.162.30","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1395584148,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277296.jpg?_r=1421643766","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tygrrlily","Id":277296,"Name":"tygrrlily","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.113.233.65","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78637,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ee85cdbcf3e5895d71f7bc3aeb6baee9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Just an update:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Gold votives\/led lights - SOLD&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wally bag - SOLD&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Bouts - SOLD&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;1 Ring bearer outfit - SOLD&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Bridesmaid bouquets - SOLD&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Stamps - SOLD&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Heart shaped chalkboard - SOLD&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Anthropologie LOVE mugs - SOLD&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1884392,"PostDate":1422391005,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Just an update:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Gold votives\/led lights - SOLD<\/p>\n<p>Wally bag - SOLD<\/p>\n<p>Bouts - SOLD<\/p>\n<p>1 Ring bearer outfit - SOLD<\/p>\n<p>Bridesmaid bouquets - SOLD<\/p>\n<p>Stamps - SOLD<\/p>\n<p>Heart shaped chalkboard - SOLD<\/p>\n<p>Anthropologie LOVE mugs - SOLD<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Married December 19, 2014 at Beach Palace Resort in Cancun, Mexico<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Planning Thread - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My Wedding Review<\/p>\n<p>Part 1 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881197'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881197<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Part 2 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881590'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881590<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Part 3 - <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881861'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77763-tygrrlilys-planning-thread-beach-palace-resort-121914\/?p=1881861<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"lilyluu83@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.119.162.30","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1395584148,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277296.jpg?_r=1421643766","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tygrrlily","Id":277296,"Name":"tygrrlily","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78637,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ce06ab5869d68348a68f91216042e6fa","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;awe I loved seeing your pics again :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I left almost everything in Mexico!! &amp;nbsp;I took out my photos, but they wanted my signs and seating charts, etc. to re-create for their promotional stuff??? they can&#039;t use them for another wedding with our info on them hehe!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I brought home the extra maracas as souvenirs for friends here, the cake topper, and the ring bearer shell. &amp;nbsp;I put them in my memory chest :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1884393,"PostDate":1422391499,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>awe I loved seeing your pics again <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I left almost everything in Mexico!! \u00a0I took out my photos, but they wanted my signs and seating charts, etc. to re-create for their promotional stuff??? they can't use them for another wedding with our info on them hehe!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I brought home the extra maracas as souvenirs for friends here, the cake topper, and the ring bearer shell. \u00a0I put them in my memory chest <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399403402,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78637,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c91df260707bd8201376a72d22d17aaf","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Interested in the blush coloured table cloths and possibly the gold painted frames as well. I sent you an email today so just let me know if they are still available.&amp;nbsp;We&amp;nbsp;live&amp;nbsp;in Markham, but my fiance works right downtown. :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1884578,"PostDate":1422518068,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Interested in the blush coloured table cloths and possibly the gold painted frames as well. I sent you an email today so just let me know if they are still available.\u00a0We\u00a0live\u00a0in Markham, but my fiance works right downtown. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;1\/st\/20151215\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ec4b\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><br><br><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1419412614,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1436293677","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"65.60.141.190","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78637,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7ebf4d3ff7654778a0b14f45201d2bab","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello,&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am brand new to this site but I see your post which I am very interested in! I will be visiting in Toronto this upcoming week so I could meet up with you to pick up items if they are still available. I am interested in the gold sequin table cloth and the gold framed table numbers. &amp;nbsp;Please let me know if these items are still for sale and we can arrange a pick up date! :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Side note - where did you get your black and white striped table runners from? I love these, but would be interested in navy and white.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks so much,&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Meghan&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1887036,"PostDate":1424487195,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello,\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am brand new to this site but I see your post which I am very interested in! I will be visiting in Toronto this upcoming week so I could meet up with you to pick up items if they are still available. I am interested in the gold sequin table cloth and the gold framed table numbers. \u00a0Please let me know if these items are still for sale and we can arrange a pick up date! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>Side note - where did you get your black and white striped table runners from? I love these, but would be interested in navy and white.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks so much,\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Meghan\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"meg71786@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"65.60.141.190","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1424485982,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282186.jpg?_r=1424580326","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"missMandM","Id":282186,"Name":"missMandM","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"76.68.33.151","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78637,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d5652540fee6ef8477142c06a768e06a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;If you still have the votive candles and led candles I&#039;d be interested! &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m in the GTA area so I could totally pick and avoid shipping! :)&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1887086,"PostDate":1424532107,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>If you still have the votive candles and led candles I'd be interested! \u00a0I'm in the GTA area so I could totally pick and avoid shipping! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>Married on June 20th, 2015 at the Grand Sunset Princess Riviera Gazebo & Reception at the Chill Out with 60 guests<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>My planning thread:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>My review thread: \u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79344-grand-sunset-princess-platinum-yucatan-princess-wedding\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79344-grand-sunset-princess-platinum-yucatan-princess-wedding\/<\/a>","Email":"rebecca.valero@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.112.94.76","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1396957652,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277519.jpg?_r=1439827749","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":132,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"veryvalentine","Id":277519,"Name":"veryvalentine","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":27,"TotalPages":3,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":20},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
