sing passport had info about the ports of call and cruise tips. The island passport had info about St. Thomas and travel information instead. <\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">I printed the passports on 110# cardstock, used my Fiskars paper cutter to do the straight lines, Fiskars corner punch to round the corners, and Martha Stewart scoring board to get a nice fold. I tied the passports through two holes with twine from Ace Hardware.<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"DSC00117.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/721885\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"DSC00109.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/721887\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"DSC00110.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/721889\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"DSC00112.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/721891\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"DSC00113.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/721893\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"DSC00115.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/721895\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"DSC00116.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/721897\/width\/600\/height\/450\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":\"11441\",\"name\":\"Passport template cruise.ppt\",\"description\":\"\",\"size\":\"798\",\"type\":\"ppt\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <span huddler_attributes=\"{\"plugin\":\"attachment\",\"params\":{\"id\":\"11442\",\"name\":\"Passport template St T.ppt\",\"description\":\"\",\"size\":\"905\",\"type\":\"ppt\"}}\" huddler_plugin=\"attachment\">\u00a0<\/span> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">\u00a0 <\/span><\/span><\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_4_1_7_1328937079078_26\"> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: medium\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"><em>to be continued...<\/em><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u0