otalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d3fb380d75e2df25ca6bec774f024a70","RawContent":"Koretta, that is so sweet! Thank you! I&#039;m glad my stuff is helpful to you! :-)\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]kks2012[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Erica, everything looks great! Just want to let you know. You are one of my role models for a cruise wedding. Your post are so helpful. The packing list is so helpful.[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1584037,"PostDate":1329629658,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Koretta, that is so sweet! Thank you! I'm glad my stuff is helpful to you! :-)<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>kks2012<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Erica, everything looks great! Just want to let you know. You are one of my role models for a cruise wedding. Your post are so helpful. The packing list is so helpful.<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span>Erica & Al - April 3, 2012 - St. Thomas, USVI<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p><strong><span><em><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/78715\/aciretas-planning-journal-april-3-2012-cruise-wedding\">Planning Thread<\/a><\/em><\/span><\/strong><\/p><span><\/span><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/79320\/aciretas-wedding-ahr-pics\"><strong><span><em>Wedding & AHR Pics<\/em><\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ericataffs@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.11.245.41","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1288624566,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-233628.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":197,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acireta","Id":233628,"Name":"acireta","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65763,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"55742ce161476796552a8936a38005c6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I can feel the excitement! They all look great.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Where\/how did you print the circular sticker? Did you order it online or was able to do it at home?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thank you!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1584046,"PostDate":1329633278,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I can feel the excitement! They all look great.\u00a0<\/p> <p> Where\/how did you print the circular sticker? Did you order it online or was able to do it at home?\u00a0<\/p> <p> Thank you!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"silverspoon5@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1327971399,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250745.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tunaandocean","Id":250745,"Name":"tunaandocean","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65763,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dd57016c2fec664665377f216b5399cb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I made the circle stickers in PowerPoint, turning them into a jpeg once I was happy with them. I made them 1.5\" and printed them on full page mailing label stickers. I used a circle punch from Michaels to cut them out.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; My template for the circle stickers is in post 3, in the packet templates files.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1584090,"PostDate":1329672041,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I made the circle stickers in PowerPoint, turning them into a jpeg once I was happy with them. I made them 1.5\" and printed them on full page mailing label stickers. I used a circle punch from Michaels to cut them out.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> My template for the circle stickers is in post 3, in the packet templates files.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span>Erica & Al - April 3, 2012 - St. Thomas, USVI<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p><strong><span><em><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/78715\/aciretas-planning-journal-april-3-2012-cruise-wedding\">Planning Thread<\/a><\/em><\/span><\/strong><\/p><span><\/span><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/79320\/aciretas-wedding-ahr-pics\"><strong><span><em>Wedding & AHR Pics<\/em><\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"ericataffs@gmail.com","IpAddress":"99.11.245.41","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1288624566,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-233628.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":197,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acireta","Id":233628,"Name":"acireta","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65763,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0757f92efef5a76afc84b24f8f68fe0f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; everything looks amazing!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1588924,"PostDate":1330624709,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> everything looks amazing!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"yu