{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":false,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":7,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":104,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1906326,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":285097,"Name":"Sam1214","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-285097.jpg?_r=1445097572","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1444936639,"LastPoster":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":2,"Preview":{"Id":1906326,"PostDate":1444936639,"PostContent":"We are getting married in November 2016 in Mexico and I have looked at sooo many different resort...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"roxy_chic_0283@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"174.90.223.112","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1444936032,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-285097.jpg?_r=1445097572","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Sam1214","Id":285097,"Name":"Sam1214","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.90.223.112","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79653,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"64a2d5b5a8a9f3aacee40e15d967656f","RawContent":"We are getting married in November 2016 in Mexico and I have looked at sooo many different resorts I am mind boggled between looking at reviews on trip advisor and finding something for our special day I have never been to Mexico before so this is becoming very difficult \n\nAny insight on beautiful wedding destinations?? Or your experiences \n\n kid friendly we have a 1 and 3 year old  and also have older children attending \n\nSwim up bars\n\nDisco bar for dancing\n\nLots of options for dining \n\nBeach wedding  \n\nWe would also like to do some excursions swim with the Dolphins ect.\n\nThought a destination wedding was supost to be stress free uhhhh just want to find a place already !","Attachments":[],"Id":1906326,"PostDate":1444936639,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We are getting married in November 2016 in Mexico and I have looked at sooo many different resorts I am mind boggled between looking at reviews on trip advisor and finding something for our special day I have never been to Mexico before so this is becoming very difficult <br>\nAny insight on beautiful wedding destinations?? Or your experiences <br>\n kid friendly we have a 1 and 3 year old  and also have older children attending <br>\nSwim up bars<br>\nDisco bar for dancing<br>\nLots of options for dining <br>\nBeach wedding  <br>\nWe would also like to do some excursions swim with the Dolphins ect.<br>\nThought a destination wedding was supost to be stress free uhhhh just want to find a place already !\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"roxy_chic_0283@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"174.90.223.112","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1444936032,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-285097.jpg?_r=1445097572","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Sam1214","Id":285097,"Name":"Sam1214","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"68.146.146.173","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79653,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by calgarybride2015, 15 October 2015 - 02:54 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1444949698,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b6c47fca956d6cdb0edaf1780722e6a9","RawContent":"Welcome and congrats!\n\n\nPicking the resort is the toughest part. I think it stresses everyone out. \n\n\nI got married at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya. It has everything on your list including the dolphins :)\n\n\nLots of packages for the wedding and some beautiful spots. The palapa was gorgeous (see my pics and such below). \n\n\nIt&#039;s considered a 5* but I&#039;ll say it&#039;s a solid 4.5* in comparison to hotels by Karisma and such. \n\n\nI suggest getting a really good TA. She can help you narrow down your resorts by your must have list. Then you can compare to their wedding packages to see if they have ones in your budget and what you envision for your day. She can also recommend some resorts that you may not have considered that are in your price point and have good reviews among other things. \n\n\nAre you from Canada or the US?\n\n\nGood luck!\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1906334,"PostDate":1444949610,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Welcome and congrats!<br><br>\nPicking the resort is the toughest part. I think it stresses everyone out. <br><br>\nI got married at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya. It has everything on your list including the dolphins <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br><br>\nLots of packages for the wedding and some beautiful spots. The palapa was gorgeous (see my pics and such below). <br><br>\nIt's considered a 5* but I'll say it's a solid 4.5* in comparison to hotels by Karisma and such. <br><br>\nI suggest getting a really good TA. She can help you narrow down your resorts by your must have list. Then you can compare to their wedding packages to see if they have ones in your budget and what you envision for your day. She can also recommend some resorts that you may not have considered that are in your price point and have good reviews among other things. <br><br>\nAre you from Canada or the US?<br><br>\nGood luck!<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399428602,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"204.237.80.98","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79653,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8b49ab9c46db525a03c16fd58ae9c5b3","RawContent":"Thanks for the recommendation I am from Canada AB :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1906389,"PostDate":1445016419,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks for the recommendation I am from Canada AB <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"roxy_chic_0283@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"174.90.223.112","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1444936032,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-285097.jpg?_r=1445097572","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Sam1214","Id":285097,"Name":"Sam1214","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.90.222.212","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79653,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0ea4d3d598d4b8bf87234833b9af8bd6","RawContent":"Me too! Calgary!  If you need help finding a TA I have mine I used and there is another in Calgary with great reviews. \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1906390,"PostDate":1445017095,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Me too! Calgary!  If you need help finding a TA I have mine I used and there is another in Calgary with great reviews. <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399428602,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"204.237.80.98","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79653,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1bf913085bc6fd073c434116e11ad632","RawContent":"Yes please i am just finding it very difficult wanting a perfect day and want this stress free as possible!","Attachments":[],"Id":1906393,"PostDate":1445018720,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Yes please i am just finding it very difficult wanting a perfect day and want this stress free as possible! \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"roxy_chic_0283@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"174.90.223.112","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1444936032,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-285097.jpg?_r=1445097572","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Sam1214","Id":285097,"Name":"Sam1214","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"179.53.158.246","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79653,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2ca8c689ba98931228dc8688bb80f785","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to our forum community, Sam1214 and Congrats on your upcoming Mexican dw!!! Calgarybride2015 has a great suggestion with the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You can see what a gorgeous backdrop it would make for your wedding photos from these magical wedding moments that matter we captured there......enjoy!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;.....from our &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10150951039939487.436910.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya Wedding Album:&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfa1\/t31.0-8\/456756_10150951043974487_952250364_o.jpg\" alt=\"456756_10150951043974487_952250364_o.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfa1\/v\/t1.0-9\/270816_10150951047479487_48048558_n.jpg?oh=8755c1340039d38c7451270c5327af3a&amp;amp;oe=56C5635D\" alt=\"270816_10150951047479487_48048558_n.jpg?\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xaf1\/t31.0-8\/194911_10150951048114487_1577340724_o.jpg\" alt=\"194911_10150951048114487_1577340724_o.jp\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you happy research and all the best with your plans - cheers!!! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1906397,"PostDate":1445022529,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to our forum community, Sam1214 and Congrats on your upcoming Mexican dw!!! Calgarybride2015 has a great suggestion with the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You can see what a gorgeous backdrop it would make for your wedding photos from these magical wedding moments that matter we captured there......enjoy!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>.....from our <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10150951039939487.436910.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya Wedding Album:<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfa1\/t31.0-8\/456756_10150951043974487_952250364_o.jpg\" alt=\"456756_10150951043974487_952250364_o.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfa1\/v\/t1.0-9\/270816_10150951047479487_48048558_n.jpg?oh=8755c1340039d38c7451270c5327af3a&oe=56C5635D\" alt=\"270816_10150951047479487_48048558_n.jpg?\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-mia1-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xaf1\/t31.0-8\/194911_10150951048114487_1577340724_o.jpg\" alt=\"194911_10150951048114487_1577340724_o.jp\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you happy research and all the best with your plans - cheers!!! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280210660,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.87.237.201","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79653,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"087308e355380f731d2b4c9564947c59","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Sam1214\"] &amp;nbsp;Congrats and welcome! @[member=\"calgarybride2015\"] has given you perfect advice! Her wedding was gorgeous - you should definitely take a look at her pics. There are several other brides-to-be here that are using the same resort. She&#039;s also absolutely right about choosing the resort being the hardest. i looked at resorts until my brain hurt, then just when i thought we were done and ready to go, a few things went wrong and I ended up back on the hunt again. But our situation is unusual so don&#039;t let it worry you. The Karisma properties are beautiful too, as are the Dreams. It will completely depend on what you want and don&#039;t want and the price point you want for your guests, your overall budget, how many guests will be attending. The good thing is that November is still low season so your price point should be a bit lower. Just bear in mind that hurricane season runs until November 30th. Some people just don&#039;t want to take the risk. Others don&#039;t worry about it at all. Another reason why a good travel agent will become your new BFF as you go through your planning journey.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck and happy planning!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1906400,"PostDate":1445023510,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"285097\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/285097-sam1214\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Sam1214<\/span><\/a> \u00a0Congrats and welcome! @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277873\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277873-calgarybride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">calgarybride2015<\/span><\/a> has given you perfect advice! Her wedding was gorgeous - you should definitely take a look at her pics. There are several other brides-to-be here that are using the same resort. She's also absolutely right about choosing the resort being the hardest. i looked at resorts until my brain hurt, then just when i thought we were done and ready to go, a few things went wrong and I ended up back on the hunt again. But our situation is unusual so don't let it worry you. The Karisma properties are beautiful too, as are the Dreams. It will completely depend on what you want and don't want and the price point you want for your guests, your overall budget, how many guests will be attending. The good thing is that November is still low season so your price point should be a bit lower. Just bear in mind that hurricane season runs until November 30th. Some people just don't want to take the risk. Others don't worry about it at all. Another reason why a good travel agent will become your new BFF as you go through your planning journey.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck and happy planning!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><em><span style=\"color:rgb(51,153,255);\">I'm lucky enough to\u00a0tell my husband how much I love him and say yes again\u00a0on October 20, 2015 at Grand Coral Beach Club!\u00a0<\/span><\/em>","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283458999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79653","Title":"Where Do We Get Married !","LastPostDate":1445023510},"Pages":{"TotalItems":7,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
