  'forumId' => '2',
  'title' => 'Nizuc Resort? Recos for non-all-in?',
  'postContent' => 'Hi! I\'m planning my wedding for early 2017 in Riviera Maya. I\'ve searched all over and I have a destination planner. My dream property is the Rosewood Mayakoba, but it\'s unaffordable for my guest. So I\'m looking for other luxury properties to get married.

I have some deal breakers:
*no all-inclusive resorts
*no kids, adults only
*no remote locations
*must have infinity pool
*I\'m not looking to have a beach/sand wedding
*non-traditional is key

I\'m really looking to make this a luxury, memorable experience for my guest. 

I\'ve stumbled across the beautiful Nizuc Resort. Does anyone have experience with this property for weddings? 

',
  'follow' => 'False',
  'sessionId' => '1e3f5e7a11d8246f410d9702e3f92b8f',
)
